                                "sense_id": "0db4f8df-b22f-33db-bbb8-4ee1280c59a9",
                                "text": "2006, Larry G. Allen, Daniel J. Pondella II, Chapter 4: Ecological Classification, Larry G. Allen, Michael H. Horn (editors), The Ecology of Marine Fishes: California and Adjacent Waters, 105,\nThe rockfishes also dominated both the deep northern and southern habitats along with pleuronectids."
