                                "sense_id": "0db4f8df-b22f-33db-bbb8-4ee1280c59a9",
                                "text": "The dynamics of those fishes that supported extensive multi-national fisheries in northern temperate and boreal waters (mainly gadids, clupeoids and pleuronectids) became a research priority (Beverton 1992)."
                            }
